WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.300
Did you ever hear the tragedy of Darth Plagueis the Wise?

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.200
I thought not.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:56.390
Well, to make a long story short, Darth Plagueis
was a dark lord of the Sith, who was so powerful

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:02.900
that he could actually use the force to influence
midichlorians to prolong someone’s life

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:09.260
indefinitely, or even... create new life...
from nothing

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:16.720
Now, we’re of course not the ones to say
whether or not that’s actually possible,

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:22.000
and even if it was, we certainly wouldn’t
want to be the ones to teach you how to do it.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.240
The dark side of the force is a pathway to
many abilities some, including us here at

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:32.940
Journey to the Microcosmos, consider to be...
unnatural.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:40.740
But, what we can teach you is more about midi-chlorians,

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.340
those powerful little beings that hold the

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:48.380
secrets of the force.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:02:00.020
Midichlorians are sentient, microscopic organisms
that reside inside each and every living cell

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:07.149
of your body, and it’s believed they originated
at the Wellspring of Life, a mystical world

00:02:07.149 --> 00:02:10.080
located in the center of the galaxy.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:17.320
Over thousands of years, we have come to depend
on midichlorians just as they have come to

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:19.220
depend on us.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:22.470
We have developed a symbiotic relationship.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.780
We are two life forms, living together...

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:37.180
Well, actually we are way more than just two
life forms.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:42.400
A person’s midichlorian count is determined
not by the number of midichlorians in their

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:48.600
body, but by the number of midichlorians per
cell in their body, and the average person’s

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:55.680
midichlorian count is around 2,500, which
means, they have about 2,500 midichlorians

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:01.180
packed into each one of the trillions of cells
in their body.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:06.940
If you’re curious about your own midichlorian
count, the easiest way to figure that out

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.850
is with a simple blood test.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:14.519
For most people though, knowing their midichlorian
count isn’t all that important.

00:03:14.519 --> 00:03:20.739
You can lead just as healthy a life with a
count of 1,500 as you can with a count of 7,000.

00:03:20.739 --> 00:03:25.650
Personally, I’m at about 3,700 for those
of you who might be wondering.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:31.519
When you start to get to counts closer to
10,000, well, that’s when things start to

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.380
become… interesting.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:39.220
You see, the higher your midichlorian count
is, the more likely you are to be able to

00:03:39.229 --> 00:03:45.050
connect with the force - that energy field
created by all living things.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:52.140
A field that surrounds us, and penetrates
us, and binds the whole frickin galaxy together.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:59.700
And for those people with midichlorian counts
around 10,000, the chances of being able to

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:05.680
harness and use the force are so high, that
if their skills are discovered at a young

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.460
enough age, they have a good chance of being
trained to become a Jedi.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:22.199
In fact, all of the samples we’re looking
at today come from the collection stored in

00:04:22.199 --> 00:04:25.949
the archives at the Jedi Temple on Coruscant.

00:04:25.949 --> 00:04:32.090
This sample here was taken from Jedi Master
Bolla Ropal when he was just 3 years old and

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:37.620
it shows that he had a midichlorian count
of just over 11,000, putting him somewhere

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:44.290
around Jedi Master Plo Koon, but far below
that of Anakin Skywalker who has a count of

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.960
well over 20,000.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:52.820
Now, obviously, not all of us get to be Jedi,
and you shouldn’t feel like bantha fodder

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:56.280
if your midichlorian count is lower than average.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:01.020
People with lower midichlorian counts have
been known to be force sensitive in the past,

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.180
even if it's not quite as common.

00:05:03.189 --> 00:05:10.129
But looking at the bigger picture, we must
remember that without midichlorians life could

00:05:10.129 --> 00:05:12.080
not exist.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:17.580
And without them we would have no knowledge
of the force at all.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:24.319
The midichlorians are continually speaking
to us, telling us the will of the force and,

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:31.360
with time, you can also learn to quiet your
mind and hear them speaking to you.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:40.580
In those moments when I’m trying to sit
back and quiet my mind, I always find it helpful

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:45.340
to reflect on the words of the great Jedi
Master Qui-Gon Jinn,

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.940
“Your focus determines your reality.”

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:56.420
Thank you for coming on this journey with
us as we explore the unseen world that surrounds us,

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.720
and may the force be with you.

